[3981]="Commander Gor'shak|52|48|9081|9020|3906||||1418|||2|||5|Find Commander Gor'shak in Blackrock Depths. You recall that the crudely drawn picture of the orc included bars drawn over the portrait. Perhaps you should search for a prison of some sort.",
