[5243]="Houses of the Holy|60|55|11036|11036||||i13180x1|1423||||||0|Travel to Stratholme, in the north. Search the supply crates that litter the city and recover 5 Stratholme Holy Water. Return to Leonid Barthalomew the Revered when you have collected enough of the blessed fluid.",
