[5263]="Above and Beyond|60|55|11039|11039|5262|||i13251x1|1423||||E|62|2|Venture to Stratholme and destroy Baron Rivendare. Take his head and return to Duke Nicholas Zverenhoff.",
[5264]="Lord Maxwell Tyrosus|60|55|11039|11034|5263||||1423||||||1|Speak with Lord Maxwell Tyrosus. He is inside the church.",
