[5281]="The Restless Souls|60|55|11038|11140|||||1423||||||1|Find Egan. You only know that he was last seen around Stratholme.",
[5282]="The Restless Souls|60|55|11140|11140|5281|||k11122x1|1423|||||1|0|Use Egan's Blaster on the ghostly and spectral citizens of Stratholme. When the restless souls break free from their ghostly shells, use the blaster again - freedom will be theirs! Free 15 Restless Souls and return to Egan.",
[5321]="The Sleeper Has Awakened|20|17|11218|11219||||i13536x1|1439|||1|||0|Escort Kerlonian Evershade to Liladris Moonriver at Maestra's Post in Ashenvale.",
[5341]="Barov Family Fortune|60|52|11022|11022||||i13448x1,i13450x1,i13451x1,i13471x1|1422|||2|||1|Venture to the Scholomance and recover the Barov family fortune. Four deeds make up this fortune: The Deed to Caer Darrow; The Deed to Brill; The Deed to Tarren Mill; and The Deed to Southshore. Return to Alexi Barov when you have completed this task.",
[5342]="The Last Barov|60|52|11022|11022|5341|||i13469x1|1422|||2|E|60|0|Travel to Chillwind Camp - Alliance territory - and assassinate Weldon Barov. Take his head and return to Alexi Barov. Be warned, Weldon will probably be well protected by Alliance scum.",
[5343]="Barov Family Fortune|60|52|11023|11023||||i13448x1,i13450x1,i13451x1,i13471x1|1422|||1|||1|Venture to the Scholomance and recover the Barov family fortune. Four deeds make up this fortune: The Deed to Caer Darrow; The Deed to Brill; The Deed to Tarren Mill; and The Deed to Southshore. Return to Weldon Barov when you have completed this task.",
[5344]="The Last Barov|60|52|11023|11023|5343|||i13470x1|1422|||1|E|60|0|Travel to the Bulwark - Horde territory - and assassinate Alexi Barov. Take his head and return to Weldon Barov. Be warned, Alexi will probably be well protected by Horde filth.",
[5361]="Family Tree|35|32|10537|11259|||||1441|||2|||0|Deliver Cliffwatcher Longhorn Report to Nataka Longhorn at Ghost Walker Post in Desolace.",
[5381]="Hand of Iruxos|38|32|11624|11624||||i13542x1|1443|||2||37|1|Retrieve the Demon Box from Thunder Axe Fortress, and return it, along with the Demon Pick to Taiga Wisemane in Shadowprey Village.",
