[6582]="The Test of Skulls, Scryer|60|55|10321|10321|6570|||i16869x1|1452||||E|60|5|You must find the blue dragonflight drake champion, Scryer, and slay him. Pry his skull from his corpse and return it to Emberstrife. You know that Scryer can be found in Winterspring.",
