[7241]="In Defense of Frostwolf|60|51|13842|13840|||||1454|||2|||0|Venture to Alterac Valley, located in the Alterac Mountains. Find and speak with Warmaster Laggrond - who stands outside the tunnel entrance - to begin your career as a soldier of Frostwolf. You will find Alterac Valley north of Tarren Mill at the base of the Alterac Mountains.",
[7261]="The Sovereign Imperative|60|51|13843|13841|||||1455|||1|||0|Travel to Alterac Valley in the Hillsbrad Foothills. Outside of the entrance tunnel, find and speak with Lieutenant Haggerdin. For the glory of Bronzebeard!",
[7281]="Brotherly Love|60|51|13154|13154||||k13320x1||||2|DE|61|0|Travel into Stormpike territory and slay Commander Karl Philips. Return to Commander Louis Philips when the task is complete.",
[7282]="Brotherly Love|60|51|13320|13320||||k13154x1||||1|DE|61|0|Travel into Frostwolf territory and slay Commander Louis Philips. Return to Commander Karl Philips when the task is complete.",
[7301]="Fallen Sky Lords|60|51|13319|13319||||k14029x1,k14030x1,k14031x1||||1|DE|60|0|Travel to Frostwolf territory and search for Wing Commander Slidore, Wing Commander Vipore, and Wing Commander Ichman. Return to Commander Duffy should you complete your mission.",
[7302]="Fallen Sky Lords|60|51|13153|13153||||k14026x1,k14027x1,k14028x1||||2|DE|60|0|Find out what became of Wing Commander Guse, Wing Commander Jeztor, and Wing Commander Mulverick. Return to Commander Mulfort should you complete your mission.",
