[7361]="Favor Amongst the Darkspear|60|51|14185|14185||||i18142x1||178||2|||1|You have been tasked with slaying opposing night elf players in Alterac Valley. Kill a night elf and return to Najak Hexxen at Frostwolf Keep with a Severed Night Elf Head.",
[7362]="Ally of the Tauren|60|51|14186|14186||||i18143x1||178||2|||1|You have been tasked with slaying opposing gnome players in Alterac Valley. Kill a gnome and return to Ravak Grimtotem at Frostwolf Keep with a Tuft of Gnome Hair.",
[7363]="The Human Condition|60|51|13154|13154||||i18144x1||178||2|||1|You have been tasked with slaying opposing human players in Alterac Valley. Kill a human and return to Commander Louis Philips (who wanders between the front lines and Frostwolf keep) with a Human Bone Chip. A cure for the human condition is close at hand!",
[7364]="Gnomeregan Bounty|60|51|14188|14188||||i18145x1||77||1|||1|You have been tasked with slaying opposing tauren players in Alterac Valley. Kill a tauren and return to Dirk Swindle at Dun'Baldar with a Tauren Hoof.",
[7365]="Staghelm's Requiem|60|51|14187|14187||||i18146x1||77||1|||1|You have been tasked with slaying opposing troll players in Alterac Valley. Kill a troll and return to Athramanis at Dun'Baldar with Darkspear Troll Mojo.",
[7366]="The Archbishop's Mercy|60|51|13320|13320||||i18147x1||77||1|||1|You have been tasked with slaying opposing Forsaken players in Alterac Valley. Kill a Forsaken and return to Commander Karl Philips (who wanders between the lumber mill and the mine) with a Forsaken Heart.",
[7367]="Defusing the Threat|60|51|13598|13598||||k13597x1||||1|DE|59|0|Find the Frostwolf Explosives Expert and kill him. Return to the Stormpike Explosives Expert when the task is complete.",
