[7441]="Pusillin and the Elder Azj'Tordin|58|54|14355|14355||||i18261x1|1444||||E|57|0|Travel to Dire Maul and locate the Imp, Pusillin. Convince Pusillin to give you Azj'Tordin's Book of Incantations through any means necessary. Return to Azj'Tordin at the Lariss Pavilion in Feralas should you recover the Book of Incantations.",
[7461]="The Madness Within|60|56|14358|14358||||k11486x1,k11496x1|||||E|61|2|You must destroy the guardians surrounding the 5 Pylons that power the Prison of Immol'thar. Once the Pylons have powered down, the force field surrounding Immol'thar will have dissipated. Enter the Prison of Immol'thar and eradicate the foul demon that stands at its heart. Finally, confront Prince Tortheldrin in Athenaeum. Return to the Shen'dralar Ancient in the courtyard should you complete this quest.",
[7462]="The Treasure of the Shen'dralar|60|56|14358|o179517|7461|||||255|||||0|Return to the Athenaeum and find the Treasure of the Shen'dralar. Claim your reward!",
[7463]="Arcane Refreshment|60|60|14368|14368||||i18299x1|||128||E|57|0|Travel to the Warpwood Quarter of Dire Maul and slay the water elemental, Hydrospawn. Return to Lorekeeper Lydros in the Athenaeum with the Hydrospawn Essence.",
[7478]="Libram of Rapidity|60|57|14368|14368|7481|||i12938x1,i14344x1,i18332x1,i18335x1||178||2|E|60|0|Bring a Libram of Rapidity, 1 Pristine Black Diamond, 2 Large Brilliant Shards, and 2 Blood of Heroes to Lorekeeper Lydros in Dire Maul to receive an Arcanum of Rapidity.",
